────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
CARVE-OUTS

1 · verdigris/topolang.js — Apache License 2.0

   The topolang runtime is licensed under Apache 2.0, whose full text ships
   as LICENSE-APACHE-2.0.txt. You may use, modify and redistribute it,
   including commercially, subject to that licence.

   It is carved out because it is an implementation of a specification.
   topolang declares a version, negotiates capabilities, and self-tests
   against a conformance vector — machinery that exists so that OTHER
   implementations can be written and checked against the same vector. A
   conformance suite nobody is permitted to conform to is decoration, so the
   runtime carries a licence that lets you write your own.

   SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0

2 · verdigris/fonts/ — SIL Open Font License 1.1

   Chivo, Literata and IBM Plex Mono, each by its own authors, redistributed
   here under the OFL. The verbatim licence for each ships alongside them as
   OFL-chivo.txt, OFL-literata.txt and OFL-plex-mono.txt; see
   verdigris/fonts/LICENSES.md. Nothing in this file restricts your rights to
   those fonts. The OFL governs them and it grants far more than this licence
   does.

